# Backend moved to private repo KonradDallaOrg/dimmy-backend on
# 2026-05-17. `backend/` is still kept on disk by some devs (clone
# of the sibling repo alongside this one) — ignoring the whole
# directory prevents accidental re-commit of any backend source,
# secrets (wrangler .dev.vars), or runtime state (.wrangler cache,
# .dev-data) into this public repo.
backend/
